{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 43","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alexis notices Joshua working with Dr. Lisi and decides to join in on the fun. Dr. Lisi challenges her to compute the sum of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> terms in the sequence. \nAlexis thinks about the problem and remembers a story one of her teachers at school taught her about how a young Karl Gauss quickly computed the sum \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/9/739eb2789a745197e3dbc1ede26447887240ec88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots+98+99+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"244\" height=\"14\" /> in elementary school. Using Gauss's method, Alexis correctly finds the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> terms in Dr. Lisi's sequence. What is this sum? \n</p><p><b>Note: Dr. Lisi’s sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/235cc06d32041c6bc90d50f14db33083d0601aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1776, -1765, -1754 \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" /></b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e0502e8060be718ac4a848bb6dfd4379cb57d10d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1776$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> and the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/e/60e9c42450a6b4ee1935742a276db94c7c0f0f9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008^\\text{th}$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/9/b49315ebbf9be77b30e808c388c2fabfdc452d1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1776 + 11 \\cdot 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"140\" height=\"14\" />.  Using the arithmetic series formula, the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> terms in Dr. Lisi's sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/0/cc08bb59dedf2c40ea8dea5c42a65d4b67f24dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{2008(-1776-1776+11\\cdot 2007)}{2} = \\boxed{18599100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"277\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 42\">Problem 42</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 44\">Problem 44</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 iTest Pro